  "description": "Commuting has never been easier. The d-WIZ Fold electric folding bike is your ideal travel companion.\n\nThe ideal electric folding bike for covering the first or last few kilometers. The d-WIZ Fold is incredibly practical and exceptionally easy to handle, making it easy to take on public transport. Once your public transport journey is over, the d-WIZ Fold will take you to your destination quickly and comfortably. Along the way, you'll benefit from the power of the powerful Bosch mid-drive motor. Whether on bike paths or through narrow city streets, the d-WIZ Fold offers the necessary comfort with its extra-wide and sturdy puncture-resistant tires. The battery is cleverly positioned, ensuring a stable ride. Moreover, you can choose how far you want to cycle by choosing between a 400 or 500Wh battery. The d-WIZ Fold is your ideal last-mile solution!\n\nThe retail price of this e-bike includes VAT and excludes a €4.50 battery recycling fee in the Netherlands.\nPlease note: specifications may vary. Consult the product details for the exact specifications or contact your dealer.",
